  "problem": "Public contract files and examples could drift from deployed operations. Old clients could silently accept a different v1.1 response shape. HTML SPA fallback could masquerade as a schema URL. The agent guide could publish stale generation labels. A successful tool envelope could be treated as a completed research task. Enrichment could be imported into worker/index.mjs.",
